  "description": "VENLIJ crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 4/m m m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C48 H108 Gd4 Na2 O13. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1R (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1P (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.545-5.013 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.00-180.00°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C48H108Gd4Na2O13. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ6-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
